opular with  Greeks and foreign tourists and was  completely unprepared the residence of  Marty stood little chance of escape the  coastal town east of Athens lacked good  evacuation access roads  there was no warning system in place  even though is a residential area  surrounded by forests and at high risk  of wildfires as the fire tore through  the town residents had a choice stay and  be burned alive or try and escape into  the sea hundreds did make it to the  water but hundreds didn't exact casualty  figures are hard to come by at least 91  people are known to have died many more  are in hospital some are in a very  serious condition and dozens are still  missing  recovering and identifying the Dead is  proving difficult sometimes impossible  because some of the bodies are so badly  burned that some body bags contain the  remains on more than one person  Kirika miracles  man or animal sadly are rare  this dog crawled into a brick built oven  behind a garden barbeque area it's white  fur now singed by the smoke and it was  barely able to breathe when it was found  by rescuers an investigation into the  response to the fire is underway it may  find more lives could have been saved by  planning for an eventuality like this  but not much else because the weather is  beyond the control of town officials  they there will be more common more  frequent extreme weather phenomena  because the climate globally is being  destabilized  [Music]  officials here in America and across the  world must now prepare and plan for this  nightmare  there have been wildfires in Britain  Sweden the Czech Republic and a deadly  heat wave in Japan this year alone with  global temperatures continuing to rise  year-on-year the warning from some  climate experts is that this is the  terrifying new normal

